@startuml
title The rho-life learning ecology, mapped onto platform surfaces
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFAF8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #54413A
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #A55B30
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #8A6D5C
}

package "The theory (rho-life corpus)" as Theory #FFF1DD {
  component "Mortal scientist\nhypothesize, probe,\nread the verdict, revise" as Scientist #FFE0B2
  component "Learner = namespace\n(population carried by\nquotation-made names)" as Learner #E3D8F5
  component "Conserved tokens\n<latex>\sigma + \kappa = \sigma_0 = \Theta</latex>\nrefutation is budget-relative" as Tokens #FFF0A8
  component "OSLF-generated logic\nnamespace-logic hypotheses\n(name predicates on quoted\nprocesses), graded separation" as Logic #D7EAF8
  component "Assay = receipt\n(where-clause guard)" as Assay #CDEACC
  component "Environment =\nother computations;\nmedium is a namespace" as Env #FFDFC4
  component "Engines\ncross-colour conversion,\nadaptive rate" as Engines #F7C7C7
}

package "The platform (implemented)" as Impl #EAF7EE {
  component "Agents at activity\nboundaries; bounded\ncritique loops" as Agents #FFE0B2
  component "Teams: parallel\ncomposition within one\nterm (TOGL Tensor)" as Teams #E3D8F5
  component "Wallets: conserved\nchain value; metered\ndeploy cost" as Wallets #FFF0A8
  component "Oslfs API + editor:\nstored, versioned\nOSLF documents" as Oslfs #D7EAF8
  component "v2 guards: pure,\neffect-free predicates" as Guards #CDEACC
  component "F1r3sky: published\nteams answering mentions;\nboost along attribution" as Firesky #FFDFC4
}

package "The meeting points (roadmap / proposals)" as Road #FDECEA {
  component "Cost, token, and\nauthority budgets —\nexhaustion as disposition" as Budgets #FFF6C9
  component "OSLF-formula guard kind\n(pinned (id, version) query)" as OslfGuard #FFF6C9
  component "Team composition with\ngraded namespace overlap\n(TOGL proposal 6)" as Compose #FFF6C9
}

Scientist --> Agents : the loop, running today
Learner --> Teams : one layer down:\ncomposition within a team
Tokens --> Wallets : value layer conserved;\nworkflow layer uncoupled
Logic --> Oslfs : sentences stored,\nnot yet evaluated
Assay --> Guards : restricted predicate\nlanguage today
Env --> Firesky : the ecology,\nsocially instantiated

Tokens --> Budgets : proposal 1:\nground the roadmap item
Logic --> OslfGuard : proposal 2:\nmake stored queries executable
Assay --> OslfGuard
Learner --> Compose : compose-note supplies\nthe overlap grading
Engines --> Budgets : design basis if budgets\never span colours

note bottom of Impl #EAF7EE
Workflow tokens are control markers —
minted at fan-out, collapsed at joins,
deliberately NOT conserved. The corpus's
conserved tokens meet them only at the
budget item.
end note

note right of Road #FFF6C9
Kernel semantics unchanged: every
meeting point is additive, stated in
the corpus's proposal register in the
rho-life and TOGL correspondence
documents.
end note
@enduml
